Z||000018||wkayl||07-22-2000||08:31 PM||||My 86 GT is compleatly stock except for the Pioneer sterio I put in (because the display didn' work on original) and the sunroof that a previous owner installed.  Today I pulled a factory sunroof panel and headliner off a car in a salvage yard to get that "stock" look.  My wife thinks I'm crazy but for $75 I couldn't pass it up.  So for the choosing between stock and mod-It's whatever makes you proud to drive.  If we all liked the same thing, they all would be red or yellow or blue or white or......||||reg||1
